<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101639" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφενδον-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>use the sling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.3.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς λίθοις ς</span>. ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ σφενδονᾶν ἡ χεὶρ γίνεται
					κέντρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mech.</u>
					852b7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>strike by slinging</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς αὔρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					26.5
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔντερ᾽ ἁλὶ καὶ σιλφίῳ
				ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Axionic.
				8.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>throw as from a sling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				25.29
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ κλιμάκων ἐσφενδονᾶτο χωρὶς ἀλλήλων
					μέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1183
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				10.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>move like a swing, swing to and fro</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλισμα . . διαφέρων ἐσφενδόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					715
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
